  "description": "Theo, who has been hiding his past and living a new life as an accountant at a small art gallery in New York, goes to meet a mysterious benefactor who suddenly appears when the gallery is in financial difficulty. There, Theo meets his half-brother Cedric, who he abandoned in 'paradise' 20 years ago, and the tragedy begins when Cedric 'subdues' Theodore.\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Hardcore BL Danpyeonseon (하드코어 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
